// A data variable bound in a nested `formerly` and ALSO constrained by a
// negated sibling atom: the negation excludes nothing here (no event has
// user "nobody"), so all three distinct amounts survive - count 3. The
// negated conjunct must filter the bindings without collapsing them.

permit ( principal, action == Drupe::Action::"Transfer", resource )
when temporal {
  exists (n: Long). (
    (count for (a: Long).
       where (formerly within 2h (
         Drupe::Action::"Transfer"::request{ input.user: context.input.user }
         && formerly within 1h (
              Drupe::Action::"Confirm"::request{ input.user: context.input.user, input.amount: a }
            )
         && !(Drupe::Action::"Confirm"::request{ input.user: "nobody", input.amount: a })
       ))
    ) == n && n == 3
  )
};
